{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白色标题首先进入视线，尤其是“以后也不变”和“真能一直这样吗”；随后下方紫色放大的“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”明显争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个很喜欢和对方待在一起的人，幸福之中开始担心这份亲密关系不能一直维持。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"开心、眷恋、不安，隐约害怕失去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"更具体的处境是，他如今害怕对方有一天不再需要自己；他想收起心意来减少受伤，却发现压抑自己的真心反而更难受。这层因果需要读下方整段才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线\",\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上方标题和下方大段文字里，要拼起来才懂\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "98418ed5-94b3-43ff-8726-f4667a240c17", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011913179466Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:19:45.808276+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a59feee4fb336845fa695b8e5b3d6462f7b3252cd83676601bc2e2300a4dfd60", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\